04_speak_to_text.mp4 | 20s | DEBUG_STT_WAV injected on hi.wav then ta.wav test clips, running the real on-device STT pipeline; transcribed sentences appear as sent messages in History with delivery ticks. Audio is injected from bundled test clips, not live microphone speech.
06_settings_text_size.mp4 | 38s | Settings tour: message text size S -> XL, theme System -> Dark -> Light, speech playback speed 0.8x -> 1.3x, then everything reset back to defaults (M / System / 1.0x), confirmed against itantra_settings.xml.
07_metrics_history.mp4 | 24s | Metrics dashboard (CPU/RAM/model size, latency histogram, STT real-time-factor) scrolled, then History screen with searchable/filterable message log scrolled.
08_hindi_ui.mp4 | 38s | App language switched from English to Hindi (हिन्दी) via Settings > App language picker, quick tour of Talk and Settings screens fully localized, then switched back to English at the end; ui_locale_tag confirmed restored to "en".

